WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.300
It is a routine, so we need the present simple: get up means to rise from bed.

2
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:19.300
“in seven” fails because clock times take at. “I'm getting at seven” uses the continuous, which is not for routines, and drops “up”.

3
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:25.700
“I get up at seven”: present simple + at with the time.
